{
  "kind": "html",
  "caption": "从左到右扫描温度，用温度单调不增的栈保存尚未找到更高温度的日期下标。当前温度高于栈顶日期时，持续弹栈，并用两天下标之差填写等待天数；每个下标至多入栈、出栈一次，时间复杂度为 O(n)。动画使用示例 1，最后留在栈中的日期右侧没有更高温度，答案保持 0。",
  "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>每日温度：单调栈演示</title>\n<style>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n  html, body{ margin: 0; background: #1c1c1c; color: #d4d4d4; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"PingFang SC\", sans-serif; font-size: 14px; }\n  body{ padding: 24px; }\n  main{ width: 100%; max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; display: grid; gap: 20px; }\n  h1 { margin: 0; font-size: 22px; color: #fff; }\n  .intro { margin: 0; line-height: 1.7; color: #bfbfbf; }\n  .panel { padding: 18px; border: 1px solid #444; border-radius: 10px; background: #252526; }\n  .panel-title { margin: 0 0 14px; font-size: 15px; color: #fff; }\n  .days { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(8, minmax(76px, 1fr)); gap: 10px; }\n  .day { min-height: 126px; padding: 10px 8px; border: 1px solid #555; border-radius: 8px; background: #2d2d30; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 7px; transition: background .3s, border-color .3s; }\n  .day.current { background: #0e639c; border-color: #3794ff; }\n  .day.resolved { background: #243447; border-color: #3794ff; }\n  .day-label, .state { font-size: 13px; color: #c8c8c8; }\n  .temp, .answer-value, .stack-index, .formula { font-family: \"SF Mono\", Monaco, Menlo, monospace; }\n  .temp { font-size: 21px; font-weight: 700; color: #fff; }\n  .answer-value { min-width: 28px; padding: 3px 7px; text-align: center; border-radius: 4px; background: #3a3a3d; color: #d4d4d4; }\n  .day.current .temp, .day.current .answer-value, .day.resolved .answer-value { color: #fff; }\n  .day.current .answer-value, .day.resolved .answer-value { background: #0e639c; }\n  .work { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(240px, .8fr) minmax(300px, 1.2fr); gap: 20px; }\n  .stack-box, .explain-box { min-height: 170px; }\n  .stack { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: stretch; gap: 10px; }\n  .stack-item { min-width: 90px; padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #3794ff; border-radius: 7px; background: #0e639c; display: grid; gap: 5px; text-align: center; }\n  .stack-index { color: #fff; }\n  .stack-temp { color: #dceeff; }\n  .empty { color: #888; line-height: 1.7; }\n  .stack-note { margin-top: 14px; color: #aaa; line-height: 1.6; }\n  .step { margin: 0 0 10px; color: #3794ff; font-weight: 700; }\n  .message { min-height: 52px; margin: 0; line-height: 1.75; color: #e1e1e1; }\n  .formula { margin-top: 12px; padding: 10px 12px; border-left: 4px solid #3794ff; background: #1c1c1c; color: #9cdcfe; line-height: 1.6; }\n  .legend { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 16px; color: #aaa; }\n  .legend span { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px; }\n  .dot { width: 14px; height: 14px; border: 1px solid #555; border-radius: 3px; background: #2d2d30; }\n  .dot.current { background: #0e639c; border-color: #3794ff; }\n  .dot.resolved { background: #243447; border-color: #3794ff; }\n  @media (max-width: 800px) {\n    body{ padding: 16px; }\n    .days { grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(68px, 1fr)); }\n    .work { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n  }\n  @media (max-width: 430px) {\n    .days { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(90px, 1fr)); }\n  }\n  /* COMPACT */ html,body{font-size:12px!important;line-height:1.45!important}body{padding:8px 10px 10px!important}main{max-width:560px!important;gap:8px!important}h1{font-size:14px!important;color:#d4d4d4!important;margin:0!important}.intro{font-size:12px!important;color:#8d8d8d!important;margin:0 0 6px!important}.panel{padding:8px 10px!important;border-radius:6px!important;border:1px solid #3c3c3c!important}.panel-title{font-size:13px!important;margin:0 0 6px!important}.days{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr)!important;gap:6px!important}.day{min-height:auto!important;padding:6px 4px!important;border-radius:6px!important;border-width:1px!important}.day-label,.state{font-size:10px!important;color:#8d8d8d!important}.temp{font-size:13px!important}.answer-value{font-size:12px!important;padding:2px 5px!important}.work{display:grid!important;grid-template-columns:1fr!important;gap:8px!important}.stack-box,.explain-box{min-height:auto!important;padding:8px 10px!important}.stack-item{min-width:64px!important;padding:6px!important;font-size:11px!important;border-radius:4px!important}.step{font-size:12px!important;margin:0 0 4px!important}.formula{border-left-width:3px!important;padding:8px 10px!important;font-size:11px!important;margin-top:6px!important}.legend{font-size:10px!important;gap:8px!important;padding:8px 10px!important}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main>\n  <section>\n    <h1>每日温度：单调递减栈</h1>\n    <p class=\"intro\">栈内保存还在等待更高温度的日期。栈底到栈顶的温度单调不增 (相等温度也要保留)，因此新温度一旦更高，就能连续解决栈顶日期。</p>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"panel\">\n    <h2 class=\"panel-title\">示例：temperatures = [73, 74, 75, 71, 69, 72, 76, 73]</h2>\n    <div id=\"days\" class=\"days\"></div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"work\">\n    <div class=\"panel stack-box\">\n      <h2 class=\"panel-title\">等待栈（左侧为栈底）</h2>\n      <div id=\"stack\" class=\"stack\"></div>\n      <div class=\"stack-note\">栈中显示“日期下标 / 温度”，右端元素是栈顶。</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"panel explain-box\">\n      <p id=\"step\" class=\"step\"></p>\n      <p id=\"message\" class=\"message\"></p>\n      <div id=\"formula\" class=\"formula\"></div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"panel legend\">\n    <span><i class=\"dot current\"></i>当前扫描日</span>\n    <span><i class=\"dot resolved\"></i>本步找到答案</span>\n    <span><i class=\"dot\"></i>仍在等待或答案为 0</span>\n  </section>\n</main>\n<script>\n(() => {\n  const temperatures = [73, 74, 75, 71, 69, 72, 76, 73];\n  const steps = [\n    { i: 0, stack: [0], answers: [0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0], resolved: [], text: '第 0 天入栈，等待未来出现高于 73°C 的日期。', formula: '栈：[0 / 73°C]' },\n    { i: 1, stack: [1], answers: [1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0], resolved: [0], text: '74°C 高于栈顶的 73°C，弹出第 0 天并填写等待天数。随后第 1 天入栈。', formula: 'answer[0] = 1 - 0 = 1' },\n    { i: 2, stack: [2], answers: [1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0], resolved: [1], text: '75°C 高于 74°C，解决第 1 天；第 2 天继续入栈等待。', formula: 'answer[1] = 2 - 1 = 1' },\n    { i: 3, stack: [2,3], answers: [1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0], resolved: [], text: '71°C 不高于栈顶的 75°C，不能解决第 2 天，直接把第 3 天压栈。', formula: '75°C > 71°C，栈内温度保持递减' },\n    { i: 4, stack: [2,3,4], answers: [1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0], resolved: [], text: '69°C 不高于 71°C，第 4 天入栈。现在有三个日期仍在等待。', formula: '栈：[2 / 75°C, 3 / 71°C, 4 / 69°C]' },\n    { i: 5, stack: [2,5], answers: [1,1,0,2,1,0,0,0], resolved: [4,3], text: '72°C 依次高于 69°C 和 71°C，因此连续弹出第 4、3 天；但它不高于 75°C，弹栈停止。', formula: 'answer[4] = 5 - 4 = 1；answer[3] = 5 - 3 = 2' },\n    { i: 6, stack: [6], answers: [1,1,4,2,1,1,0,0], resolved: [5,2], text: '76°C 先解决第 5 天，再解决第 2 天。栈清空后，第 6 天入栈。', formula: 'answer[5] = 1；answer[2] = 6 - 2 = 4' },\n    { i: 7, stack: [6,7], answers: [1,1,4,2,1,1,0,0], resolved: [], text: '73°C 不高于 76°C，第 7 天入栈。扫描结束后，栈内日期都没有更高温度。', formula: '第 6、7 天保持 0' },\n    { i: -1, stack: [6,7], answers: [1,1,4,2,1,1,0,0], resolved: [], text: '扫描完成。每个日期至多入栈、出栈一次，因此总时间复杂度是 O(n)，额外空间复杂度是 O(n)。', formula: '最终答案：[1, 1, 4, 2, 1, 1, 0, 0]' }\n  ];\n\n  const daysEl = document.getElementById('days');\n  const stackEl = document.getElementById('stack');\n  const stepEl = document.getElementById('step');\n  const messageEl = document.getElementById('message');\n  const formulaEl = document.getElementById('formula');\n\n  function render(step, number) {\n    daysEl.innerHTML = temperatures.map((temp, index) => {\n      const classes = ['day'];\n      if (index === step.i) classes.push('current');\n      if (step.resolved.includes(index)) classes.push('resolved');\n      let state = '等待判断';\n      if (step.answers[index] > 0) state = '已找到更高温';\n      if (number === steps.length - 1 && step.answers[index] === 0) state = '之后无更高温';\n      return `<div class=\"${classes.join(' ')}\"><div class=\"day-label\">第 ${index} 天</div><div class=\"temp\">${temp}°C</div><div class=\"answer-value\">${step.answers[index]}</div><div class=\"state\">${state}</div></div>`;\n    }).join('');\n\n    stackEl.innerHTML = step.stack.length\n      ? step.stack.map(index => `<div class=\"stack-item\"><div class=\"stack-index\">下标 ${index}</div><div class=\"stack-temp\">${temperatures[index]}°C</div></div>`).join('')\n      : '<div class=\"empty\">栈为空</div>';\n\n    stepEl.textContent = number === steps.length - 1 ? '完成' : `步骤 ${number + 1} / 8`;\n    messageEl.textContent = step.text;\n    formulaEl.textContent = step.formula;\n  }\n\n  let cursor = 0;\n  render(steps[cursor], cursor);\n  setInterval(() => {\n    cursor = (cursor + 1) % steps.length;\n    render(steps[cursor], cursor);\n  }, 1900);\n})();\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>",
  "svg": "",
  "media": ""
,"time_complexity":"O(n)","space_complexity":"O(n)","complexity_note":"n 为温度数组长度. 每个日期下标至多入栈、出栈一次; 单调栈最坏占 O(n), 返回的答案数组也占 O(n)."}
